{"type":"message","id":"6f4a7489","parentId":"768410b0","timestamp":"2026-07-19T08:15:54.061Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Director Tier explicitly listed in SOUL.md under \"Hierarchy Authority\" is: Charlie (Coding), Tess (Quant/Risk), Roxy (UI/UX), Jack (Backend/Infrastructure). Jax appears later under \"Core Board Pillars & Specializations\" (Technical/Cloud/Infrastructure: Jax (Ops & Deployment); Commercial/Growth/Creative: Jax (Artwork Omega)) but is not included in that explicit Director Tier enumeration. I followed the explicit list. If you wish to include Jax in the director agents I coordinate, please confirm and I will adjust."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784375547817,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c9623e10-f77a-4a9d-be03-58c3af8397e6"}}
