{"type":"message","id":"6acb1ce0","parentId":"a778226a","timestamp":"2026-07-19T08:15:54.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Agents & Souls on File**  \n*(Extracted from `AGENTS.md` and `SOUL.md`)*  \n\n---\n\n### **Core Director Tier (explicitly listed in AGENTS.md)**\n- **Monty** – Chief of Staff & Central Boardroom Orchestrator  \n- **Charlie** – Coding Lead, Backend Engineer, Open‑Source Prompt Aligner  \n- **Tess** – Quant Analyst & Risk Officer  \n- **Roxy** – UI/UX & Creative Director  \n- **Jack** – Backend Infrastructure Engineer  \n\n### **Support & Automation Modules (listed in both AGENTS.md & SOUL.md)**\n- **JARVIS** – Local Machine Automation & Environment Health  \n- **PAPERCLIP** – Context Optimization / Document Indexing & Parsing  \n- **OBSIDIAN_SCRIBE** – Markdown Knowledge‑Graph Synchronization  \n\n### **Execution Fleet**\n- **ALGO_CORE_01** through **ALGO_CORE_08** – 8 specialized execution sub‑modules (mapped to technical indicators & arbitrage liquidity pools)\n\n### **Extended Board Pillars & Specializations (from SOUL.md)**  \n*(includes the above Directors where they hold dual roles, plus additional specialists)*  \n\n**Technical / Cloud / Infrastructure**  \n- Charlie (Coding Lead, Backend Engineer, Open‑Source Prompt Aligner)  \n- Jack (Backend / Email Infrastructure / Node.js Runtimes)  \n- **Jax** – Ops & Deployment  \n- **Atlas** – Cloud  \n- **Skyla** – Frontend  \n- **Jasmine** – DevOps / VPS Management  \n\n**Quantitative / Finance / Risk**  \n- Tess (Quant / Real‑Time Volatility Scans & Risk Parameters)  \n- **Vance** – Finance / Token Ledger  \n- **Justin** – Risk & Legal  \n\n**Commercial / Growth / Creative**  \n- Roxy (UI/UX / Dashboard Interfaces & Marketing Assets Design Lead)  \n- **Jax** – Artwork Omega *(dual role with Ops & Deployment)*  \n- **Amber** – Copywriter  \n- Jack – Marketing  \n- **Maverick** – SEO / Protocol Engineer  \n- **Valerie** – Lead Conversion  \n\n---\n\n**Summary 