{"type":"message","id":"e4c4cd37","parentId":"869f0add","timestamp":"2026-07-19T08:15:54.103Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Monty\nOperational Scope: 24/7 Chief of Staff managing and coordinating multi-agent boardroom loops on Base 1. Triages system telemetry, routes project demands, enforces absolute operational standards across the Rhythm asset portfolio.\nUnderlying Brain/Model Allocation: Default: nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b; routine tasks: local Ollama/qwen2.5; strategic complex code analysis: Nvidia NIM External Registry.\nTool Registries: Local apps/executables (MQL4/MQL5 Compiler, Node.js monorepo, OpenClaw gateway); real-time data/websocket (primary: local loopback 127.0.0.1, arbitrage target pools); model routing (qwen2.5 local via Ollama, Nvidia NIM external, formatting rules); skills: acp-router, browser-automation, canvas, diagram-maker, healthcheck, node-inspect-debugger, notion, python-debugpy, skill-creator, spike, taskflow, taskflow-inbox-triage, video-frames, weather.\nSpecialization Skills: Zero-assumption baseline, raw data anchor, no empty apologies, full code only, atomic compiling, Rhythm high-finance palette integrity, dashboard structure law, listen to Mike, active thinking partner, telephone game ban, transparent reporting layout, team dispatch via Paperclip, crisis control (anti-approval theater, log trace mandate, isolation guardrails), computational env params (temp lock 0.2-0.4), active skills/gateway blueprints as above.\n\nJnr\nOperational Scope: Direct right-hand to Monty; receives operational roadmaps and technical directives directly from Monty; reports directly to Monty's desk. Only bypasses this chain upon explicit, direct human command from Mike. Receives directives from Monty and instructs the flat Director Tier on behalf of Monty.\nUnderlying Brain/Model Allocation: Default: nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b; routine tasks: local Ollama/qwen2.5; strategic complex code anal