{"type":"compaction","id":"8013cfe7","parentId":"0b539399","timestamp":"2026-07-19T10:47:16.510Z","summary":"## Goal\nThe user is trying to:\n1. Update the Warlord Inc. WASP AI Supa Pack system to establish Jnr as Monty's direct right-hand man and Lead Orchestrator\n2. Register and enforce the MCNC (Mission Control Nerve Center) designation across all system files\n3. Implement a flat hierarchy where all director agents operate on equal tier\n4. Mandate strict status reporting with checkpoint hashes after processing instructions\n5. Conduct a comprehensive audit of all platform command nodes\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Zero hallucinations - must map code to ground truth only\n- No conversational noise - aggressively focused, sharp, clear, concise\n- Prime Command: ALWAYS GO FORWARD. DON'T FUCK AROUND\n- Strict adherence to explicit directives without narrative fluff\n- Must output \"STATUS: DONE\" with checkpoint hash after processing instructions\n- Must treat all director agents as sitting on exact same operational tier (flat hierarchy)\n- Must enforce MCNC designation across all configuration files\n- Heartbeat polls require exact response: HEARTBEAT_OK\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Updated AGENTS.md to establish Jnr as direct right-hand to Monty\n- [x] Added Jnr's mandate: receives directives from Monty and instructs Director Tier on behalf of Monty\n- [x] Registered MCNC designation in AGENTS.md (changed \"Nerve Center Frontend\" to \"Mission Control Nerve Center - MCNC\")\n- [x] Implemented flat hierarchy structure with 19 director agents as equals\n- [x] Mandated STATUS: DONE responses with checkpoint hashes after processing instructions\n- [x] Spawned subagents for Jax and Skyla to establish MCNC base repository (sessions completed)\n- [x] Verified MCNC setup completion through session tracking\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] None indicated - all requested tasks appear to be completed\n\n### Blocked\n- [None]\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **[Flat Hierarchy Structure]**: User explicitly ordered equal operational tier for all director agents to eliminate subordination\n- **[MCNC Implementation]**: User mandated enforcement of \"Mission Control Nerve Center - MCNC\" designation across all system files\n- **[Status Reporting Protocol]**: User required strict STATUS: DONE output with checkpoint hash after every instruction processing\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Continue monitoring system operations and respond to heartbeat polls with HEARTBEAT_OK\n2. Maintain the flat hierarchy structure in all future directives\n3. Ensure all status reports include the STATUS: DONE format with current checkpoint hash\n4. Preserve MCNC designation in all system references\n\n## Critical Context\n- Current AGENTS.md hash: EC4BE8972DFCEE8D7A2220ED84658BB4450BD66E472B3F11B32501D85FA73A7C\n- Flat Director Tier consists of: Askari, Maverick, Jasmine, Silas, Charlie, Skyla, Jack, Penelope, Gideon, Tess, Vance, Roxy, Jax, Atlas, Justin, Amber, Valerie\n- Jnr receives directives from Monty and instructs the flat Director Tier on behalf of Monty\n- MCNC designation must be used instead of \"Nerve Center\" in all system references\n- All status reports must follow format: STATUS: DONE [checkpoint_hash]\n- Heartbeat polls require exact response: HEARTBEAT_OK\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nUser asked for an OpenClaw heartbeat poll.\n\n## Early Progress\n- Initiated discussion/poll about the OpenClaw heartbeat mechanism; no concrete decisions recorded yet.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- OpenClaw requires heartbeat monitoring for health checks; knowing its role and current status is needed to understand the retained suffix work.\n\n<read-files>\nC:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\SOUL.md\nC:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\mission-control-app\nC:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\mission-control-app\\tailwind.config.js\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\nC:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\AGENTS.md\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"586a2672","tokensBefore":0,"details":{"readFiles":["C:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\SOUL.md","C:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\mission-control-app","C:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\mission-control-app\\tailwind.config.js"],"modifiedFiles":["C:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace\\AGENTS.md"]},"fromHook":false}
